      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuánta vida por las calles de Ciudad Luminalia!\n¡Se ven Pokémon mires donde mires!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando me contaron que aquí la gente convive\ncon los Pokémon, no tardé en comprar un<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nboleto y reservar un hotel para venir de visita.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pensaba que aquí la gente estaría muy unida a\nsus Pokémon, pero me estoy dando cuenta de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nque lo que tenemos mi equipo y yo es especial.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cleffa y Buneary fueron mis primeros Pokémon.\nCuando empecé eran tan pequeñitos...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero llevamos mucho tiempo viajando juntos y,\nal cabo de un tiempo, evolucionaron<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na Clefairy y Lopunny.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Sabes qué? ¡Estos dos solo evolucionan si\nte tienen muuucho apego!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0053006100620065007300200071007500E9003F002000A1004500730074006F007300200064006F007300200073006F006C006F002000650076006F006C007500630069006F006E0061006E002000730069000A007400650020007400690065006E0065006E0020006D00750075007500630068006F00200061007000650067006F002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ah, ya sé!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Qué te parece si comprobamos cuánto nos\nquieren nuestros Pokémon con un combate?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Avísame si tienes ganas de combatir!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007600ED00730061006D00650020007300690020007400690065006E00650073002000670061006E0061007300200064006500200063006F006D00620061007400690072002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Vienes a luchar? Creo que si nos enfrentamos,\npodrás ver lo unida que estoy a mis pequeños.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, luchemos",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750065006E006F002C0020006C0075006300680065006D006F00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mejor en otro momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006A006F007200200065006E0020006F00740072006F0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Sí? Ah, qué lástima.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005300ED003F002000410068002C00200071007500E90020006C00E1007300740069006D0061002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Genial! Tengamos un combate amistoso.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470065006E00690061006C0021002000540065006E00670061006D006F007300200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200061006D006900730074006F0073006F002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf, perdimos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550066002C002000700065007200640069006D006F0073002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se nota que tu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁýĀs Pokémon y tú se llevan increíble.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650020006E006F00740061002000710075006500200074007500100003110100FD0100007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000790020007400FA0020007300650020006C006C006500760061006E00200069006E00630072006500ED0062006C0065002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Diría que se llevan casi tan bien como mis\nPokémon y yo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100440069007200ED006100200071007500650020007300650020006C006C006500760061006E00200063006100730069002000740061006E0020006200690065006E00200063006F006D006F0020006D00690073000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020007900200079006F002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ay, no!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410079002C0020006E006F002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mis pobres pequeñines están un poco tristes\ndespués de haber perdido.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069007300200070006F006200720065007300200070006500710075006500F10069006E00650073002000650073007400E1006E00200075006E00200070006F0063006F00200074007200690073007400650073000A0064006500730070007500E900730020006400650020006800610062006500720020007000650072006400690064006F002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tendremos que pasar más rato relajándonos\nen algún café.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006E006400720065006D006F007300200071007500650020007000610073006100720020006D00E100730020007200610074006F002000720065006C0061006A00E1006E0064006F006E006F0073000A0065006E00200061006C006700FA006E002000630061006600E9002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Supongo que ya lo sabes, ¡pero es una gran\nforma de fortalecer tu vínculo con tus pequeños!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Nada que una relajante taza de café con leche\nno pueda arreglar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006100640061002000710075006500200075006E0061002000720065006C0061006A0061006E00740065002000740061007A0061002000640065002000630061006600E900200063006F006E0020006C0065006300680065000A006E006F002000700075006500640061002000610072007200650067006C00610072002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Pokémon son mucho más que solo unas\nherramientas para combatir.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEs muy importante dedicar tiempo a cultivar\nnuestra relación con ellos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ay, mis pequeñines, los quiero tanto...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Y en amor y en relajarnos en los cafés no nos\ngana nadie!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
